  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Armor has almost no effect on your spellcasting.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Arcane Armor Mastery<sup>CRB</sup>, 2nd mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You don’t have to spend a swift action to gain the reduction to arcane spell failure chance from Arcane Armor Mastery. Furthermore, you reduce your total arcane spell failure reduction for any armor you are proficient with by 30%.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc6\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
